{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical team-building auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team as you explore maps full of monsters, build synergies, equip items and cast spells to support your team during battles and help them escape the Underboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/GifFights.gif?t=1744614832\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters battle on their own based on positioning and aggression. Look out for enemy threats and position your team accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast spells to actively support your team in battles or provide them with passive bonuses. Upgrade your best spells or go for more tactical flexibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/GifManagement.gif?t=1744614832\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft a team of characters with random trait bonuses. Get more characters with the same traits to upgrade them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your characters by killing monsters and gaining experience, then unlock their evolutions by killing bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and craft items with stat bonuses, extra traits or unique effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build synergies by equiping items to your characters and casting your spells to support them, there are thousands of possibilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map Explorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/GifExploration.gif?t=1744614832\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore randomized maps with fog of war and full of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find as many rewards as you can before the map boss finds you, then kill them to reach higher maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge pinnacle bosses at the end of your explorations and kill them to unlock harder zones to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock masteries as you explore, allowing you to specialize your teams for future explorations!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2376610?t=1744614832","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/3c591dd941aa2b0d2bccf5fcd60cfe4384d30a54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744614832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744614832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744614832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3442130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical team-building auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team as you explore maps full of monsters, build synergies, equip items and cast spells to support your team during battles and help them escape the Underboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/GifFights.gif?t=1744614832\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters battle on their own based on positioning and aggression. Look out for enemy threats and position your team accordingly.</p>